+3. Launch a fresh reviewer without inherited conversation (`fork_turns="none"` where supported), loading shared rules plus `REVIEWER.md`. Supply only original requirements, acceptance, candidate location/revision, check commands/results, relevant contracts, prior findings and a review output path. Filter forwarded records to exclude plans, conversations and memory. Keep the candidate unchanged while review runs. Missing fresh-review capability blocks acceptance.
